 not found</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"section\">\n<p>We're sorry, but the page you were looking for - <strong>http://webaim.org/articles/article</strong> - could not be found. This could be due to the following reasons:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>The URL you typed into the address bar was entered incorrectly. You should check that out.</li>\n\t<li>The page you came from  lists an outdated or incorrect link. Shame on them!</li>\n\t<li>We recently updated our site and the page you're looking for is no longer available.</li>\n\t<li>Something has gone terribly, awfully awry.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Please select from the navigation items above, perform a search for a relevant term, or <a href=\"/\">visit the homepage</a>. Or if you're sure it's our fault, please <a href=\"/contact/\">contact us</a>.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n</article>\n<!--\n\t-->\n<aside id=\"articlemeta\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n</aside>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n\t<div id=\"footerresources\">\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"copyright\">©2026 WebAIM</h2>\n\t\t\t<p id=\"contact\">\t\t\tUtah State University<br>\n\t\t\t6807 Old Main Hill<br>\n\t\t\tLogan, UT 84322-6807<br>\n\t\t\t<a class=\"phone\" href=\"tel:4357977024\">435.797.7024</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div id=\"checkpage\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Check Your Accessibility</h2>\n\t\t\t<form action=\"https://wave.webaim.org/report\" novalidate=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<label for=\"waveurl\">Web site address:</label>\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"url\" id=\"waveurl\" name=\"url\" title=\"Web site address\">\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"submit\" value=\"WAVE\">\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"blog\">From the Blog</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul><li><a href=\"/blog/a-new-path/\">A New Path for Digital Accessibility?</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/2026-predictions/\">2026 Predictions: The Next Big Shifts in Web Accessibility</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/word-and-powerpoint-alt-text-roundup/\">Word and PowerPoint Alt Text Roundup</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/accessibility-by